window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A reincarnated soul who remembers his previous life’s happiness and heartache...</p> <p>Quint is a Player. Unlike most of society who restart with a blank slate after they die, Players make the choice to reincarnate with their memories fully intact. He’s using his past-life knowledge to make his way in a new world, and he’s taking full advantage of it to help him find someone he’s lost.</p> <p>In their past lives, Quint and Leo were in love. In the afterlife, they made a pact that when they were reborn into the next life, they would find each other again. Except Leo doesn’t seem to be keeping his promise. Running out of leads, Quint turns to his last option, an exclusive, mysterious app where lost souls like him can reconnect with their past lives: The Player’s Lounge.</p> <p>But what he finds is not what he expects...</p> <p>'The Player’s Lounge' is the debut novel from prolific M/M audiobook narrator Dan Calley.</p>"; 
